            "block_content": "2. The Company shall increase and maintain the number of full time thirty (30) hour or more merchandise handling positions as designated in Section 5B in the Downtown Store at no less than thirty (30). All subsequent thirty-hour (30) positions shall be offered as per Section 17E.",
